+`#[derive(Deserialize)]` with `#[serde(tag = "..")]` buffers its input as a
+`serde_core::private::content::Content` (`Serde/De.lean`) with `TaggedContentVisitor`, then
+deserializes the variant from the buffer with `ContentDeserializer`.
