+  contentVisitorStep (X := Ω) ContentSeedΩ ContentVisitorΩ
+
+/-- `impl<'de> DeserializeSeed<'de> for ContentVisitor<'de>`:
+    `deserializer.__deserialize_content_v1(self)`. -/
