+/-! Evaluate the model of `tests/src/fn-items-nonfailing.rs` on the inputs of its `native` test module
+    and compare with the native results: function items of functions which cannot fail (`Vec::len`,
+    `i64::checked_neg`, `u8::from`, `u32::wrapping_add`, `Box::new`) passed to `map`, `and_then` and
+    `fold` or called from a local, and a local function item (fallible in the translation), whose
+    overflow panics natively. -/
